      "name": "[Fragile][Hoshimi Miyabi] Frost Inferno - Lv.50",
      "desc": "Hoshimi Miyabi's exclusive Tactical Prism.\nAfter Hoshimi Miyabi executes a Powerful Slash on an enemy, she immediately restores 1 Fallen Frost point.\nEnemies afflicted with <color=#FFFFFF>Icefire</color> <color=#2BAD00>take <color=#98EFF0>Frost DMG</color> equal to 260% of Hoshimi Miyabi's ATK per second</color>. Upon triggering <color=#FFFFFF>Frostburn - Break</color>, Hoshimi Miyabi can bypass the restrictions of <color=#FFFFFF>Frostburn</color> and <color=#2BAD00>immediately reapply <color=#FFFFFF>Icefire</color> to enemies</color>.",
